# Preserve unique parser/build/mount source; exclude only runtime products.
/isolated_blockers/20261109_a/work/
/isolated_blockers/20261109_a/state/
/isolated_blockers/20261109_a/evidence/*
!/isolated_blockers/20261109_a/evidence/instrumentation.patch
